<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico to drain 809 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico to drain 809 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico sought to drain 809 million pesos from the secondary market on Wednesday, dealers said.</p>
<p>Cetes sales were offered as follows:</p>
<p>     AMOUNT	 TERM</p>
<p>	150 million    351 days</p>
<p>	150 million    176 days</p>
<p>	150 million     85 days</p>
<p>Terms and maturities of repurchase agreements were offered as follows:</p>
<p>	150 million	94 days</p>
<p>	209 million	1 day</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9559))</p>
</text>
